&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking a Managing Principal (Director level) to lead our Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. This role is ideal for someone who combines strategic vision with deep regulatory reporting expertise and a proven track record of leading complex, multi-jurisdictional transformation programmes. You&#39;ll partner with global financial institutions to deliver regulatory change, optimise reporting controls, and ensure sustained compliance across key reporting regimes including EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, CFTC, HKMA, and MAS. You&#39;ll also champion AI-enabled ways of working, helping clients and teams responsibly leverage approved AI tools, automation, and data-driven insights to improve reporting quality, operational efficiency, and decision-making while maintaining strong governance and human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
