&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wf5i0o&quot; data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Advise clients on regulatory implementation, remediation, and control optimisation across EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, HKMA, MAS, CFTC, and other reporting frameworks, ensuring robust governance and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1is7zcm&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;Design, assess, and enhance reporting architectures, data lineage, reconciliations, and data quality frameworks, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to strengthen reporting accuracy and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nfakql&quot; data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;Guide the implementation of regulatory reporting platforms and RegTech solutions, ensuring responsible AI adoption, appropriate validation, and effective oversight of AI-assisted outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bps73q&quot; data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Lead strategic client relationships, proposition development, business growth, and thought leadership within Capco&#39;s Regulatory Reporting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
